<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Cafe Rewards</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body class="app-page">
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-brand"><span class="topbar-icon">☕</span> Cafe Rewards</div>
    <a href="/login" class="topbar-cta">Staff Login →</a>
  </header>

  <main class="page-wrap landing-wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Loyalty points that are always exactly right.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">A points-based rewards system for cafe chains — members earn on every
        purchase, climb Bronze → Silver → Gold, and redeem for free items, with a balance that
        can never drift out of sync.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">💳</div>
        <h3>Earn on every purchase</h3>
        <p>Points are credited automatically at a rate based on the member's current tier.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🏆</div>
        <h3>Automatic tiers</h3>
        <p>Bronze, Silver, and Gold progression based on lifetime spend — never demoted by redeeming.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎁</div>
        <h3>Safe redemption</h3>
        <p>Every redemption is checked against the live balance, so it can never go negative.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Fast counter lookup</h3>
        <p>Staff can find any member instantly by phone number, even in a long member list.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
        <h3>Full history</h3>
        <p>Every purchase and redemption is logged, so balances are always auditable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
        <h3>Search, sort, paginate</h3>
        <p>The member list stays fast and usable no matter how many members sign up.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h2>Who it's for</h2>
        <p>Cafe chains and their front-counter staff who need a fast, reliable way to track
           customer loyalty points without manual bookkeeping or balance errors.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>How it helps</h2>
        <p>Removes manual point-tracking errors, speeds up the checkout line via phone-number
           lookup, and rewards loyal customers automatically — increasing repeat visits.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="roadmap">
      <h2>Next 3 features we'd build</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>SMS/email notification when a member is about to reach the next tier</li>
        <li>Configurable rewards catalog (admin can set point costs per item)</li>
        <li>Analytics dashboard for owners (top spenders, redemption trends, tier distribution)</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>